   - Passes `note_position=` to all `amp_predictor()` calls (train + test loops)

3. **`src/model/evaluate.py`** — Evaluation:
   - Reads `amp_note_position_conditioned` from config
   - Passes to AmpPredictor constructor
   - Extracts `note_position` from frame_features in `evaluate_diffusion()`
